  "source": "module bit_routes(input [7:0] data, input enable,\n                  output [7:0] swapped, masked, output parity, all_set);\n  assign swapped = {data[3:0], data[7:4]};\n  assign masked = data & {8{enable}};\n  assign parity = ^data;\n  assign all_set = &data;\nendmodule\n"
